WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.170
A flash of lightning
lights up the sky.

2
00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:07.650
Then, after a pause, comes
a deep rumble of thunder.

3
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:11.130
But the flash and the thunder
are made at the same moment,

4
00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:12.650
in the same place.

5
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.250
So why does one reach you first?

6
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.830
To find out, you'll follow light.

7
00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:20.390
You'll see how it crosses empty space,

8
00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:23.770
and how a tiny hole in a
box can make a picture.

9
00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:27.070
Then you'll watch light bounce
off mirrors and split into

10
00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:28.190
colours.

11
00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.230
Do your eyes just work
faster than your ears?

12
00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:35.010
Your mission: explain why you
see lightning before you hear

13
00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:36.090
thunder.
